# U2 OpnForm/OpnForm client, commit 413c20cb837f595035b11c41927658778d654d1e
# Hand-derived from the client/pages tree (59 .vue files). No definePageMeta path/alias overrides, no pages:extend hook, no router.options.
# Nuxt rules: index -> parent path, [id] -> :id, [[id]] -> :id?, [...slug] -> "*" (pages/[...all].vue -> /*).
# A parent.vue with a child index.vue shares the index URL (pages/forms/[slug]/show.vue + show/index.vue -> /forms/:slug/show).
# @nuxtjs/i18n locale prefixes are not included.
